    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 31f8d03d: a_full_depth_centreline_trace_is_blocked_by_the_post_gouge_gate passes without a change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nThis result proves only the requested post-gate behavior. It does not establish that the other requested route and UI tests exist.\n\nThe pin creates a 10 x 10 x 7 mm model box and a D6 Trace to Z0. post_setup returns: post blocked - gouge: program cuts below the model in 608 cell(s), worst 4.00 mm at (0.19, 0.19, z 0.00). No NC file is written.\n\nHistorical implementation: e158b885 added verification post gating. Commit 0e180912 added the solid-part verdict.\n\nCommand: cargo --config env.SCCACHE_DIRECT.value=\\\"false\\\" --config env.SCCACHE_DIRECT.force=true test -p camcraft-app --test contour_centre_distance -- --nocapture. The optional direct cache was disabled after its directory was denied by the sandbox.\n\nStopped under the worker instruction that a pin passing on unchanged code ends the run. No product code changed. No PR was opened. The uncommitted pin remains in .claude/worktrees/issue-1929/crates/app/tests/contour_centre_distance.rs on issue/1929-contour-centre-distance. Claim released.\n",
